"""Authored Reading & Writing items, part 5 (original text; researchers and characters are fictional).
Central ideas and text structure: 8 more per difficulty, so a student practicing one skill at their level meets
fresh passages for several more sessions. Loaded after parts 1-4 so older index-based uids never shift.
Distractors are written to be as long and specific as the key (see tests/rw_quality.py)."""
from bank.rw_content import rec, Q_MAIN, Q_PURPOSE, Q_FUNC, Q_STRUCT

